      _push(`<p data-v-f8296f14> So we chose social entrepreneurship: using entrepreneurship to solve social problems, with the help of today&#39;s technology, especially AI. </p><p data-v-f8296f14> AI changed what a small team can do. Websites and tools that once needed an agency budget can now be built quickly and well, and the servers we already run for the platform have room to spare. That lets us price our work for small budgets and still earn enough to keep the mission going. </p><p data-v-f8296f14> Instead of asking for help, we earn our way, by solving a real problem for people who are short on resources too. Serving them is part of the mission, not just a way to pay for it. </p></article></div></section><section class="problems-section" data-v-f8296f14><div class="container" data-v-f8296f14><div class="section-header" data-v-f8296f14><h2 data-v-f8296f14>Two Problems, One Engine</h2><p data-v-f8296f14>We serve two kinds of people with limited resources, and our work for one keeps the help for the other going.</p></div><div class="problem-pair" data-v-f8296f14><article class="problem-card" data-v-f8296f14><p class="problem-label" data-v-f8296f14>For clients with small budgets</p><h3 data-v-f8296f14>Big ideas, small budgets</h3><p data-v-f8296f14> Solo founders, freelancers, coaches, writers, small businesses and non-profits often can&#39;t afford agency prices, or risk a big payment up front on an idea that might not work. </p><p class="problem-answer" data-v-f8296f14><strong data-v-f8296f14>Our answer:</strong> a free working prototype first and no development fee, then a monthly plan. The Care Plan is priced to your project, and the Simple Website Plan is $20 a month, plus your own domain. </p>`);
