      _push(`.</p></div><div class="policy-section" data-v-7f387ede><h2 data-v-7f387ede>Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h2><p data-v-7f387ede> Across all Skill-Wanderer properties, we use <strong data-v-7f387ede>essential cookies and browser storage only</strong>, the minimum required for our services to function correctly. We do not use tracking cookies, advertising cookies, analytics cookies, or any other non-essential cookies or storage on any subdomain. </p><p data-v-7f387ede> The specific cookies and storage used vary by subdomain, depending on the backend technology in use: </p><ul data-v-7f387ede><li data-v-7f387ede>On the <strong data-v-7f387ede>Dojo</strong> (dojo.skill-wanderer.com), Keycloak sets essential session cookies to maintain your authenticated state. These are strictly necessary for login and course access.</li><li data-v-7f387ede>On <strong data-v-7f387ede>Wanderings</strong> (wanderings.skill-wanderer.com), interactive features may use browser localStorage or IndexedDB to keep you signed in. Anonymous reading does not involve any storage.</li><li data-v-7f387ede>On the <strong data-v-7f387ede>main site</strong>, a localStorage entry records your cookie banner acknowledgement.</li><li data-v-7f387ede>On <strong data-v-7f387ede>future subdomains</strong>, the specific cookies and storage will depend on the technologies used, but will always be limited to essential purposes only.</li></ul><p data-v-7f387ede> For embedded video content, we use YouTube&#39;s Privacy-Enhanced Mode (<code data-v-7f387ede>youtube-nocookie.com</code>) to minimise third-party cookie impact. YouTube will not set cookies unless you actively play a video. </p><p data-v-7f387ede> For full details on the specific cookies and storage used per subdomain, please read our `);
